{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"長洲東灣泳灘發現21萬支香煙　約值逾94萬元\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SMOKE-BEACH-261026-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】長洲東灣泳灘發現逾20箱懷疑私煙，警方列作檢獲應課稅品處理，交海關跟進。</p><p>網上片段可見，海面及沙灘上有多個綠色包裝的物品，警方接報到場，發現內有21萬支香煙，約值逾94萬元，懷疑為未完稅私煙。案件列作檢獲應課稅品，轉交海關跟進。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24.648865+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T15:53:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.574221+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:26.284270+00:00","content_hash":"d9c72930bb3e1ed22158d56f210259593654ac90897c4e541678ddeef4a56c1a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24.648865+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}